// gleam_stdlib, reviewed against the source of 0.70.0 and 0.71.0.
// Older releases are not reviewed.
// The pure modules' functions hand their callbacks values drawn from their
// data arguments only, never run a function nested in one (they cannot, by
// their types, save the decoder runners), and return data drawn from their
// arguments and their callbacks' results.

covers 0.70.0 to 0.71.0
